{"id":"15acd2ee71b7bcb7","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-neighborhood-representation.md","title":"邻域函数恰表示Baire连续数值泛函","display":"thm-neighborhood-representation — 邻域函数恰表示Baire连续数值泛函","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-neighborhood-representation","aliases":["72-thm-neighborhood-representation"],"display":"thm-neighborhood-representation — 邻域函数恰表示Baire连续数值泛函","depends_on":["[[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]]","[[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]]","[[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.5–2.6, print425–427/PDF437–439; complete local representation proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-neighborhood-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-neighborhood-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-neighborhood-representation — 邻域函数恰表示Baire连续数值泛函"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4505d236865c21c\" href=\"?note=d4505d236865c21c\" title=\"72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code\">72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54bd0de31af513e7\" href=\"?note=54bd0de31af513e7\" title=\"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function\">72-df-baire-neighborhood-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9538412e70727870\" href=\"?note=9538412e70727870\" title=\"72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity\">72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.5–2.6, print425–427/PDF437–439; complete local representation proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_F\">\\(\\gamma_F\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\)</span> 时使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NB}\">\\(\\operatorname{NB}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_\\gamma\">\\(F_\\gamma\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_\\gamma\">\\(\\mu_\\gamma\\)</span> 使用本册原有全部三个条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma_F)\\land F_{\\gamma_F}=F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma_F)\\land F_{\\gamma_F}=F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\gamma\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}}\\\n(\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\land F_\\gamma=F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\gamma\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}}\\\n(\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\land F_\\gamma=F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若某非空柱集恒值，则任意延长柱集仍恒为同一值，给正值稳定性。对 α 取连续性长度 n，再延到 max(n,1)，该柱集恒值，故每条分支遇到正值。正值本身记录 F(α)+1，所以解码恢复 F。反向用既有邻域函数连续性定理即可。整个证明在外部集合论中，不把所有连续泛函等同于递归泛函。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code","status":"resolved","id":"d4505d236865c21c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-baire-neighborhood-function","status":"resolved","id":"54bd0de31af513e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"9538412e70727870","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NB}","display":false},{"tex":"F_\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma_F)\\land F_{\\gamma_F}=F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\gamma\\in\\omega^{\\omega^{<\\omega}}\\\n(\\operatorname{NB}(\\gamma)\\land F_\\gamma=F).","display":true}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"